{"said":"aura-2-hyperion-en\nIf you want a local language model or embeddings in Java, there are options. They work, though they're often slower than they should be. [pause] But what if you want to isolate the vocals from a track? Read a stack of invoices? Turn a storyboard into footage? Or any of a plethora of other capabilities? [pause] Until now, from the JVM, you were stuck. It meant a Python stack, or a tool like Comfy U.I. behind HTTP: another runtime, another process, and a network hop on every call. Kiln calls the native engines directly. No Python, no server, nothing in between.","words":[{"word":"if","start":0.24,"end":0.56},{"word":"you","start":0.56,"end":0.64},{"word":"want","start":0.64,"end":0.88},{"word":"a","start":0.88,"end":0.96},{"word":"local","start":0.96,"end":1.1999999},{"word":"language","start":1.1999999,"end":1.5999999},{"word":"model","start":1.5999999,"end":1.92},{"word":"or","start":1.92,"end":2.08},{"word":"embeddings","start":2.08,"end":2.6399999},{"word":"in","start":2.6399999,"end":2.8},{"word":"java","start":2.8,"end":3.5199997},{"word":"there","start":3.6799998,"end":3.9199998},{"word":"are","start":3.9199998,"end":4.16},{"word":"options","start":4.16,"end":4.96},{"word":"they","start":5.2799997,"end":5.52},{"word":"work","start":5.52,"end":6.16},{"word":"though","start":6.3199997,"end":6.48},{"word":"they're","start":6.48,"end":6.7999997},{"word":"often","start":6.7999997,"end":7.04},{"word":"slower","start":7.04,"end":7.44},{"word":"than","start":7.44,"end":7.68},{"word":"they","start":7.68,"end":7.7599998},{"word":"should","start":7.7599998,"end":8},{"word":"be","start":8,"end":8.559999},{"word":"but","start":9.2,"end":9.44},{"word":"what","start":9.44,"end":9.679999},{"word":"if","start":9.679999,"end":9.76},{"word":"you","start":9.76,"end":9.92},{"word":"want","start":9.92,"end":10.08},{"word":"to","start":10.08,"end":10.24},{"word":"isolate","start":10.24,"end":10.559999},{"word":"the","start":10.559999,"end":10.719999},{"wo